      "highlights": "Community Engagement: As a responsible corporate citizen, Demo Manufacturing continues to consider community engagement an integral part of its long-term value creation strategy. During FY 2025-26, the Company advanced its CSR initiatives with focused interventions in healthcare, education, skill development and environmental sustainability. These initiatives aim to make a tangible difference in the communities where the Company operates, while also contributing to broader socio-economic development; The Company also strengthened community engagement and impact awareness through focused CSR communication initiatives. As part of the Champions of Change series, multiple videos featuring farmer beneficiaries were released during the year. DML also planned an Agriculture Knowledge Podcast Series in partnership with Krishi Vigyan Kendras (KVKs) and Meghdoot to promote agricultural awareness and knowledge sharing."
