      "highlights": "Product Quality & Safety: We continue to strengthen our manufacturing footprint with a focused approach on operational excellence, capacity enhancement, and technology-driven processes across our two core business divisions—Agri Machinery and Construction Equipment. Our manufacturing strategy is aligned with our long-term growth ambitions, enabling us to deliver high-quality, efficient, and reliable products to meet evolving customer and market needs; DML is committed to ensuring a safe and healthy workplace while minimising environmental impact across all its operations. The Company focuses on the prevention of occupational injuries, ill health, and pollution by adopting safe technologies, responsible practices, and continuous improvement in EHS performance. It complies with all applicable legal and regulatory requirements and strives to exceed standards through robust governance, employee training, and stakeholder engagement. DML actively promotes resource conservation, energy efficiency, and sustainable practices, while fostering a strong safety culture where every employee is accountable for maintaining high EHS standards."
