      "highlights": "Customer Engagement: DML serves a diverse set of customers engaged in infrastructure and industrial development, including construction and engineering companies, government and public sector agencies, mining operators, rental and leasing companies, and individual contractors. The Company’s construction equipment portfolio are marketed under the Demo Manufacturing and Demo Manufacturing brands; comprises material handling cranes, road compaction machinery, and earthmoving equipment, contributing to the development of critical sectors such as infrastructure, mining, cement, power, etc. With over 250 customer touchpoints across India and a presence in more than 30 countries, DML ensures strong product accessibility, service support, and continuous customer engagement. The Company places a strong emphasis on safety, reliability, and lifecycle performance, while systematically integrating customer feedback to enhance product quality, operational efficiency, and overall customer experience."
