      "highlights": "Emission Management: Demo Manufacturing Limited (DML) has committed to becoming carbon neutral by 2050. As part of this long-term goal, we aim to reduce Scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions by 25% by FY 2029-30, using FY 2022-23 as the base year. The Company is committed to reducing its greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions through energy efficiency and increased adoption of renewable energy. Consistent reduction between FY 2022-23 and FY 2024‑25 suggests effective emission control measures and improved efficiency. The increase in FY 2025-26 is attributed to higher production volumes. Focused energy optimisation and transition initiatives contributed to a reduction in CO2 emissions."
