      "highlights": "Sustainable Products: DML integrates eco-design principles into its product development lifecycle, reinforcing its commitment to sustainability and responsible manufacturing. Environmental considerations are embedded at the design stage, enabling the Company to minimise the ecological footprint of its products throughout their lifecycle. Key focus areas include recyclability, fuel efficiency, durability, and ease of repair, which are systematically incorporated into product specifications. This approach not only reduces environmental impact but also enhances product longevity, resource efficiency, and customer value. The Company’s Research & Development (R&D) ecosystem is supported through a combination of in-house capabilities and selective global collaborations, facilitating access to advanced technologies, innovation frameworks, and industry best practices. This enables DML to continuously improve product performance while aligning with global sustainability trends."
