      "highlights": "3R: Reduce, Reuse, Recycle: Sustainability transcends compliance at Demo Manufacturing; it is embedded in our operational DNA and long-term strategy. We have implemented comprehensive ESG frameworks across water conservation, renewable energy adoption in manufacturing, and circular economy practices for equipment lifecycle management. Our factories now feature solar power integration and upgrading to zeroliquid discharge systems, delivering both environmental stewardship and cost efficiencies; Demo Manufacturing Limited partnered with Green Globecare to recycle waste paper generated across its Faridabad facilities during April 2025-March 2026. This initiative aligns with the Environment (Protection) Act, 1986 and supports the company’s ESG commitments."
