      "highlights": "Water Positivity: To become a water positive organisation by FY 2029-30, we are committed to responsible water management, including reducing freshwater consumption and enhancing recycling practices. There is a declining trend in water consumption from FY 2022-23 to FY 2024-25, followed by a moderate increase in FY 2025-26; Water risk assessments using recognised frameworks have informed site‑level Water Risk Management Plans for water‑stressed locations. DML tracks withdrawals, consumption, discharge and recycling across facilities, with the ambition of achieving water positivity by FY 2029-30. DML is progressing towards its ambition of achieving water positivity by FY 2029–30, supported by ongoing initiatives focused on improving water use efficiency, enhancing recycling and reuse, and strengthening water stewardship practices."
