      "highlights": "What began humbly in 2018 has evolved into a deep and strategic partnership that now underpins our global ambitions. Today, this partnership is reflected in shared engineering capabilities, joint product development, cross-border R&D collaboration, and the integration of India into Demo Manufacturing’s global supply chain. During the year, approximately 60% of our export volumes were channelled through Demo Manufacturing’s international distribution network—demonstrating the strength and scalability of this integration; Our collaboration with Demo Manufacturing Japan remains central to co-developing implements and platforms suited to Indian conditions, while partnerships with agricultural institutions and model farms are helping drive mechanisation awareness, skill development, and adoption of best practices."
