      "metrics": [],
      "highlights": "Corporate Social Responsibility Policy: After the introduction of the concept of Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) in the Companies Act, 2013 and rules made thereunder {including any statutory modification(s) or re-enactment thereof for the time being in force} [hereinafter referred to as “the Act”], Corporate Social Responsibility (“CSR”) has gained prominence from all avenues. Organizations also accepted and realized that Government alone will not be able to get success in its endeavour to uplift the society. With the rapidly changing corporate environment, more functional autonomy, operational freedom etc., Demo Manufacturing Limited (Demo Manufacturing) has adopted CSR as a strategic tool for overall sustainable growth. Much before the issue of CSR became a global concern, Demo Manufacturing had been aware of its CSR and was fulfilling the aspiration of the society through various social initiatives and charity. This has resulted into a harmonious relationship between Demo Manufacturing and its peripheral communities."
