      "highlights": "Competition Compliance Policy: Demo Manufacturing Limited believes in fair business practices and market driven competition. It strives to do business with integrity and trust. DML does not engage in any practice that is prohibited under The Competition Act, 2002 and is committed to complying with the provisions of the Competition Act in letter and in spirit. DML’s endeavour is to ensure that all its personnel conduct themselves in compliance with the Competition Act. This Competition Compliance Policy sets out the broad contours within which DML and its personnel must conduct business to ensure compliance with the Competition Act. The CCP applies to all DML’s personnel, including its employees, management, business partners and persons acting on its behalf. Please review the CCP carefully and ensure compliance with it. The CCP is to be read as part of the Code of Business Conduct of DML and will be updated from time to time."
