      "highlights": "At DML we are committed to: Uphold strong governance through transparent disclosures, ethical practices, and adherence to the Code of Conduct, while strengthening ESG integration. Ensure sustainable products and services by prioritizing safety, quality, and resource efficiency across the value chain. Promote employee well-being by fostering a safe, inclusive workplace and targeting 15% gender diversity by 2031 in employee category. Environmental goals under the ESG strategy: (i) Carbon neutrality by 2049-50, with a 25% CO2 reduction by 2029-30 for Scope 1 + 2. (ii) Zero waste to landfill by 2026-27. (iii) Water positivity by 2029-30. (iv) Triple renewable energy share by FY 2029–30."
